Name: Google Play Services Ads Identifier
Short Name: play-services-ads-identifier
URL: https://developers.google.com/android/guides/setup
Version: 18.0.1
License: Android Software Development Kit License
License File: LICENSE
Security Critical: yes
CPEPrefix: unknown

Description:
Google Play Services Ads Identifier library provides access to the Advertising ID on Android devices.
This is used by the Branch SDK for attribution and tracking purposes.